===Adjective===
{{en-adj}}
[[File:Phe, Mueang Rayong District, Rayong, Thailand - panoramio - Pinochet68.jpg|thumb|adherent sand]]

# [[adhesive|Adhesive]], [[stick]]ing to something.
#* {{quote-book|en|year=1738|author=Alexander Pope|title=Imitations of Horace|section=Book II, Epistle II|passage=Close to the cliff with both his hands he clung <br/>And stuck '''adherent''', and suspended hung.}}
# Having the quality of [[cling]]ing or sticking fast to something.
# {{lb|en|botany}} Attaching or pressing against a different [[organ]].
# {{lb|en|medicine|of a person}} Showing [[adherence]] to a [[treatment]].
#* {{quote-journal|en|year=2007|month=June|author=Min Yang; Jamie C. Barner; Jason Worchel|title=Factors Related to Antipsychotic Oversupply Among Central Texas Veterans|journal=w:Clinical Therapeutics|volume=29|issue=6|doi=10.1016/j.clinthera.2007.06.013|page=1217|passage=Half (49.9%) of patients were '''adherent''' to their regimens, 42.6% were underadherent, and 7.6% had medication oversupply.}}

